{"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Property","symbolKind":"property","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"element","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"title":"element","externalID":"s:7IvorMXL18MXLElementPositionV7elementSSSgvp"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"element","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Maps to the MusicXML ","type":"text"},{"code":"element","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" attribute.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The element type for a descendant of the next sibling element that is not a link or bookmark."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlelementposition\/element"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLElementPosition\/element","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLElementPosition"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLElementPosition":{"type":"topic","title":"MXLElementPosition","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLElementPosition"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlelementposition","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLElementPosition","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLElementPosition","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The element and position attributes are new as of Version 2.0. They allow for bookmarks and links to be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"positioned at higher resolution than the level of music-data elements. When no element and position attributes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are present, the bookmark or link element refers to the next sibling element in the MusicXML file. The element"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"attribute specifies an element type for a descendant of the next sibling element that is not a link or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"bookmark. The position attribute specifies the position of this descendant element, where the first position","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is 1. The position attribute is ignored if the element attribute is not present. For instance, an element","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"value of “beam” and a position value of “2” defines the link or bookmark to refer to the second beam","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"descendant of the next sibling element that is not a link or bookmark. This is equivalent to an XPath test of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"[.\/\/beam[2]] done in the context of the sibling element."}]},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLElementPosition/element":{"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"element"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"title":"element","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLElementPosition\/element","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlelementposition\/element","role":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The element type for a descendant of the next sibling element that is not a link or bookmark."}]},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"collection","title":"IvorMXL","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter."}]}}}